          "title": "You'll want to know: গবেষণা",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "গবেষণা — gôbeshônā — \"research\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মীরা বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়ে গবেষণা করে। mīrā bishvôbidyālôye gôbeshônā kôre. Mira does research at the university."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "গবেষণা (gôbeshônā) is Sanskrit gaveṣaṇā, beside gaveṣaṇa, seeking or searching (Monier-Williams), which files the verb gaveṣ, to seek, among the compounds of go, a cow. Bengali uses it for scholarly research."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
